>  http://www.geocities.com/illinois24/base16.jpg
>  
>  Explanation:
>  
>  dau - a lower case d
>  fei - a backwards F
>  gai - greek letter gamma
>  jau - resembles an uppercase J
>  rei - the closest to an R on 7SD (lower case r would conflict with the
> gamma for gai)
>  vai - I could have used U without conflict, but I opted for a backwards 4
> instead. Looks a little like V if you squint and shake your head a little.
